The algorithms follow published work; the implementations are this module's own:

- Exposure fusion: T. Mertens, J. Kautz and F. Van Reeth, "Exposure Fusion", Pacific
  Graphics 2007, with the Laplacian pyramid of P. J. Burt and E. H. Adelson, "The
  Laplacian Pyramid as a Compact Image Code", IEEE Transactions on Communications, 1983.
- Tone mapping: E. Reinhard, M. Stark, P. Shirley and J. Ferwerda, "Photographic Tone
  Reproduction for Digital Images", SIGGRAPH 2002 (the global operator).
- Non-local means: A. Buades, B. Coll and J.-M. Morel, "A non-local algorithm for image
  denoising", CVPR 2005.
- Bilateral filter: C. Tomasi and R. Manduchi, "Bilateral Filtering for Gray and Color
  Images", ICCV 1998.
- Noise estimation: J. Immerkaer, "Fast Noise Variance Estimation", Computer Vision and
  Image Understanding, 1996.
